pinyon-shift-fh1-render-test-v1
# FH1-only real source rendering at an unlocked host rate.
# clock-hz 60
# expect-performance 50000 55 80 500
# expect-distinct-presentation 55
input 0 0000 0 0 0 0 0 0
input 720 1000 0 0 0 0 0 0
input 732 0000 0 0 0 0 0 0
input 960 1000 0 0 0 0 0 0
input 972 0000 0 0 0 0 0 0
input 1200 1000 0 0 0 0 0 0
input 1212 0000 0 0 0 0 0 0
input 1440 1000 0 0 0 0 0 0
input 1452 0000 0 0 0 0 0 0
input 1560 0000 0 255 0 0 0 0
capture 1800 drive-start
capture 2400 drive-mid
capture 3000 drive-end
input 3120 0000 0 0 0 0 0 0
capture 3480 settled
stop 3540
